
# <type>: <short summary, imperative, at most 72 characters>
#
# Types (pick exactly one):
#   major:   breaking change (API, configuration, CLI flags, chart values, resource schema)
#   minor:   backwards compatible new feature
#   patch:   bug fix or small improvement, no behaviour change for users
#   hotfix:  urgent fix for something broken in a released version
#
# Examples:
#   minor: add http_timing attribute to rintup_monitor
#   patch: retry metric upload after a 429 response
#   major: rename cluster.key to cluster.secretKey in values.yaml
#
# Body (optional): explain what and why, wrap at 72 characters.
# Do not add Co-Authored-By or "Generated with" lines.
# Do not use em dash or en dash characters.
